{"properties":{},"id":"haitong-push-template-test-03","groupId":"haitong-push-operations-04","name":"03.模板配套推送测试","path":"/template-test","method":"POST","parameters":[],"options":[],"headers":[{"name":"Content-Type","value":"application/json","required":true,"dataType":"String","description":"表数据使用JSON；附件原文先通过/api/v1/file-uploads/single上传"},{"name":"X-Api-Key","value":"","required":true,"dataType":"String","description":"填写当前数据源第五步签发的业务密钥，不使用编辑器密码或节点同步密钥"},{"name":"Idempotency-Key","value":"push-template-demo-001","required":true,"dataType":"String","description":"相同请求重复测试保留原值；改变业务内容时换一个值"}],"paths":[],"description":"与《数据推送登记模板-联调示例》对应。默认示例使用本机已登记的测试数据源，表名push_template_demo，5个字段，attachment_file_id为可选附件字段。真实调用原统一推送流程，不代填密钥、不跳过登记与权限校验。先在节点管理同步配置，再填写该源X-Api-Key和Idempotency-Key。FTP返回受理后用02.消息状态查询确认最终投递结果。附件先上传，等待READY，再将fileId写入attachment_file_id；没有附件可省略该字段。其他环境须替换datasourceId。","requestBody":"{\n  \"deliveryType\": \"FTP\",\n  \"datasourceId\": \"2113672667642568704\",\n  \"tableName\": \"push_template_demo\",\n  \"batchId\": \"TEMPLATE-DEMO-001\",\n  \"records\": [{\n    \"record_id\": \"TEMPLATE-RECORD-001\",\n    \"business_no\": \"TEMPLATE-BIZ-001\",\n    \"occur_time\": \"2026-10-24 08:00:00\",\n    \"title\": \"数据推送模板联调测试\"\n  }]\n}","responseBody":"{}","requestBodyDefinition":null,"responseBodyDefinition":null}
